{"4415050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Tram", "steam_appid": 4415050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4957860], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A TRAM DRIVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a classic tram and guide it along scenic routes inspired by Central and Eastern Europe of the 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the tram’s systems, navigate challenging sections of track and harsh weather conditions, keep to the schedule, and ensure passenger comfort while traveling between residential districts, suburbs, and industrial areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic tram handling</strong><br>Learn how the systems and electronics of a classic tram work. The car’s weight, inertia, and track condition demand careful, attentive driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric city</strong><br>Explore a fictional city inspired by Central and Eastern Europe in the mid-2000s: panel housing districts, forest stretches, industrial areas, and a historic center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic driving conditions</strong><br>Weather, temperature, and rail condition directly affect the tram’s behavior and require you to adapt your driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging route sections</strong><br>Worn curved rails, gradients, and speed restrictions will test your control and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driver responsibility</strong><br>Follow the timetable, carry passengers, and keep an eye on their comfort level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1152 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving a tram isn’t as easy as it may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 16-ton machine is sensitive to speed, weather, and track condition, so the driver must stay focused and precise. Slippery rails, frost, worn curves, and other infrastructure quirks will test your skills and your ability to adapt to real-world conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers trust your professionalism and want to arrive on time. Can you live up to that trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD AROUND YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fictional yet richly detailed city awaits, inspired by Eastern and Central Europe in the mid-2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panel housing districts, forest sections, industrial zones, and an old town center create a varied and atmospheric urban environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city in any season, at any time of day, and in different weather—conditions directly affect the tram’s handling and present new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT’S AVAILABLE IN EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• drive two routes with a total length of about 15 km <br>• master a classic tram with detailed, functional systems<br>• test yourself on demanding sections with worn curved rails<br>• operate the tram in different weather and across seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the timetable, feel the inertia of a heavy car, and carefully control your speed to avoid violations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tram</strong> is an atmospheric tram driving simulator created by people passionate about urban transport. Its journey is just beginning, and we would be happy to grow the game together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, the game already includes the core driving mechanics, two routes, and basic simulation systems. In the future, we plan to expand the city map, introduce new trams, add gameplay mechanics, and develop additional routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be closely following your feedback and suggestions!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A TRAM DRIVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a classic tram and guide it along scenic routes inspired by Central and Eastern Europe of the 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the tram’s systems, navigate challenging sections of track and harsh weather conditions, keep to the schedule, and ensure passenger comfort while traveling between residential districts, suburbs, and industrial areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic tram handling</strong><br>Learn how the systems and electronics of a classic tram work. The car’s weight, inertia, and track condition demand careful, attentive driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric city</strong><br>Explore a fictional city inspired by Central and Eastern Europe in the mid-2000s: panel housing districts, forest stretches, industrial areas, and a historic center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic driving conditions</strong><br>Weather, temperature, and rail condition directly affect the tram’s behavior and require you to adapt your driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging route sections</strong><br>Worn curved rails, gradients, and speed restrictions will test your control and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driver responsibility</strong><br>Follow the timetable, carry passengers, and keep an eye on their comfort level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1152 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/9caabfe87c702b7d67de590013625281.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving a tram isn’t as easy as it may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 16-ton machine is sensitive to speed, weather, and track condition, so the driver must stay focused and precise. Slippery rails, frost, worn curves, and other infrastructure quirks will test your skills and your ability to adapt to real-world conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passengers trust your professionalism and want to arrive on time. Can you live up to that trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD AROUND YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fictional yet richly detailed city awaits, inspired by Eastern and Central Europe in the mid-2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panel housing districts, forest sections, industrial zones, and an old town center create a varied and atmospheric urban environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city in any season, at any time of day, and in different weather—conditions directly affect the tram’s handling and present new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/25d8ca4731fcedde9b61636a172f77b1.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT’S AVAILABLE IN EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• drive two routes with a total length of about 15 km <br>• master a classic tram with detailed, functional systems<br>• test yourself on demanding sections with worn curved rails<br>• operate the tram in different weather and across seasons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the timetable, feel the inertia of a heavy car, and carefully control your speed to avoid violations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.poster.avif?t=1785187178\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.webm?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/extras/0c8365458caf4893012e87f0473424d7.mp4?t=1785187178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tram</strong> is an atmospheric tram driving simulator created by people passionate about urban transport. Its journey is just beginning, and we would be happy to grow the game together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, the game already includes the core driving mechanics, two routes, and basic simulation systems. In the future, we plan to expand the city map, introduce new trams, add gameplay mechanics, and develop additional routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be closely following your feedback and suggestions!</p>", "short_description": "Discover tram driving on routes inspired by Eastern and Central Europe of the 2000s. Realistic physics, demanding weather and operating conditions, and a richly detailed city turn every trip into a true driver’s challenge.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Ukrainian, Belarusian, Armenian, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Finnish, Czech, Japanese, French, Hungarian, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/e0f4089c2b9dd5b47cffe3eecbdcfa83009d1487/header.jpg?t=1785187178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/f3e8a641189101394881f710d12cb0da838a5ea9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785187178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415050/f3e8a641189101394881f710d12cb0da838a5ea9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785187178", "website": "https://the-tram.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  64-bit Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.9 GHz AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-10400F or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT, each with 8 GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements will be refined and actualised during development.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  64-bit Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.6 GHz, 8 cores or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 TI or AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT, each with 11 GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements will be refined and actualised during development.</li